    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d28">

                <pb facs="0170" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg42"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.6212Anti-War/28</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May 1,
                        1928</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received May 14.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3473</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the Department’s telegram
                    No. 43, (Paris No. 118) of April 23, 5 p.m., on the question of a multilateral
                    treaty for the renunciation of war, I have the honor to transmit herewith an <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Aide Memoire</hi><anchor n="45" xml:id="d28-f1"/>
                    thereon which I handed to the Minister for Foreign Affairs, Dr. Stresemann on
                    April 27.</p>
                <p>In addition to the foregoing and in confirmation of the Embassy’s telegram No. 85
                    of April 28, 11 a.m.,<anchor n="45" xml:id="d28-f2"/> I have the honor to
                    transmit, in the original as well as translation, the reply of the German
                    Government, dated April 27, to the note which I handed Dr. Stresemann on April
                    13 on the same subject (See Embassy’s telegram No. 72 of April 13, 7 p.m.<anchor
                        n="46" xml:id="d28-f3"/>)</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacob Gould
                    Schurman</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d28-a1.xml" xpointer="d28-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
